  "blocks": {
    "208a3b29-c11f-468a-91d2-46f9ac88232d": {
      "@type": "html", 
      "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Nesta atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o, foram inclu\u00eddas 22 novas DCBs e tr\u00eas foram alteradas.</p>"
    }, 
    "4ce99902-663e-45ac-9464-be72e0f6af26": {
      "@type": "html", 
      "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Denomina\u00e7\u00e3o Comum Brasileira\u202f(DCB) \u00e9 a denomina\u00e7\u00e3o do f\u00e1rmaco ou princ\u00edpio ativo aprovada pelo \u00f3rg\u00e3o federal respons\u00e1vel pela vigil\u00e2ncia sanit\u00e1ria (</span><span><a href=\"http://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/Leis/L9787.htm\">Lei\u202f9.787/1999</a></span><span>). Atualmente, com o registro eletr\u00f4nico,&nbsp;o termo&nbsp;adquiriu um conceito mais amplo e inclui tamb\u00e9m a denomina\u00e7\u00e3o de insumos inativos, soros\u202fhiperimunes\u202fe vacinas, radiof\u00e1rmacos, plantas medicinais, subst\u00e2ncias homeop\u00e1ticas e biol\u00f3gicas.\u202f\u202f</span></p>"
    }, 
    "4eb6258c-8344-439c-a700-dd210ca32dfa": {
      "@type": "dateSocialShareBlock", 
      "fixed": true, 
      "required": true
    }, 
    "55927c7d-7b30-4096-8eb6-ef5db137b38a": {
      "@type": "title", 
      "fixed": true, 
      "required": true
    }, 
    "74251e0b-aeca-4ad0-b2d8-03359aa4268f": {
      "@type": "description", 
      "fixed": true
    }, 
    "9c2a699d-0c34-4838-90cc-ce0dc4bdcc47": {
      "@type": "html", 
      "html": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Anvisa informa que foi atualizada a lista das Denomina\u00e7\u00f5es Comuns Brasileiras (DCBs), oficializada pela publica\u00e7\u00e3o da&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" data-tippreview-enabled=\"false\" data-tippreview-image=\"\" data-tippreview-title=\"\" href=\"https://anvisalegis.datalegis.net/action/UrlPublicasAction.php?acao=abrirAtoPublico&amp;num_ato=00000416&amp;sgl_tipo=INM&amp;sgl_orgao=DC/ANVISA/MS&amp;vlr_ano=2025&amp;seq_ato=000&amp;cod_modulo=134&amp;cod_menu=1696\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Instru\u00e7\u00e3o Normativa \u2013 IN 416, de 17 de dezembro de 2025<b></b></a>.</p>"
    }, 
    "c7c53bc5-2c36-443a-b95d-2db82db84074": {
      "@type": "html", 
      "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Outras informa\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no Processo SEI 25351.900083/2025-46.</p>"
    }, 
    "cd6ad916-43ea-4aea-ae41-2dacb5e8992e": {
      "@type": "subtitleBlock", 
      "fixed": true
    }, 
    "d6472b63-7bfe-495c-88d0-f2f904c8f65b": {
      "@type": "html", 
      "html": "<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Lista Consolidada das DCBs est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel na Biblioteca Digital da Anvisa:&nbsp;<span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"x_OWAAutoLink\" data-auth=\"NotApplicable\" data-linkindex=\"0\" href=\"http://bibliotecadigital.anvisa.gov.br/jspui/handle/anvisa/19593\" id=\"OWA1f3db4b4-fbc2-3035-890a-0d3125ea7de7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"http://bibliotecadigital.anvisa.gov.br/jspui/handle/anvisa/19593\">http://bibliotecadigital.anvisa.gov.br/jspui/handle/anvisa/19593</a></span></span>.</p>"
    }, 
    "df21d0dc-1db1-464a-9b25-e7468e6fd286": {
